# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 本地配置绝不进 git（本仓库是公开仓库，运行时会话数据含本机路径与个人信息）
# 前缀匹配：catalog.json* / selection.json* 同时覆盖 .bak.<stamp>、-2 等副本
# Local state must never be tracked: the plugin writes these into
# $DSH_HOME/software-tools/, and a stray copy inside the checkout must not be
# committable.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
catalog.json*
selection.json*
# timestamped backups written next to the state files (<file>.bak.<stamp>)
*.bak.*
# an accidental full DSH home / config dir inside the checkout
.dsh/
config/
# secrets and machine-local env overrides
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# build / dependency noise (unchanged intent, grouped here for clarity)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
lib/*.map
# atomic-write temp files (temp file + rename); a crash must not leave one tracked
*.tmp-*
*.log
.DS_Store
